{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/hashicorp/consul-template","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:05:24.120Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/hashicorp/consul-template/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/hashicorp/consul-template"},"readme":"# Supported Tags\n\n- Click on \"Tags\" to see all available tags.\n\n# Quick Start\n\nThe most straightforward way to use this image is to just run it:\n\n```\n$ docker run hashicorp/consul-template\n```\n\nThe container behaves the same as executing the raw binary, accepting the same flags, options, and configuration.\n\nThe default container is built from scratch with vendored CA certificates. There's also an `alpine` container which uses `gosu` and `dumb-init` for more advanced uses:\n\n```\n$ docker run hashicorp/consul-template:alpine\n```\n\nThe alpine container provides volumes for configuration and data. It's also possible to pass in local configuration via an environment variable.\n\n```\n$ docker run -e 'CT_LOCAL_CONFIG=log_level = \"debug\"' hashicorp/consul-template\n```","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"hashicorp","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/hashicorp","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2017-05-25T16:34:12.115226Z","updated":"2026-09-10T17:27:21.461081Z","categories":["Networking","Security","Integration & delivery"],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":155091661,"stars":32},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":1446240044,"tags":[{"name":"0.43","digest":"sha256:dab302fcaae4ef85c3de0b83bdd53088ca24e0f8a92691d5bed50654a0ff8570","pushed":"2026-09-10T17:27:20.88902Z","size":9495047,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/arm64","linux/386","linux/arm/v6"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":"active"},{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:dab302fcaae4e